---
import LeadForm from './LeadForm.astro';
---

<section id="consultation" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24" aria-labelledby="consultation-title">
  <span id="cta" class="absolute -top-24" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1 bg-brand-600" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(28rem,1.1fr)] lg:gap-16">
      <div class="pt-2 text-white lg:sticky lg:top-32">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-300">Tidak perlu mengulang cerita di WhatsApp</p>
        <h2 id="consultation-title" class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-4xl font-black leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.035em] text-white sm:text-5xl">
          Temukan program yang paling masuk akal untuk tujuanmu.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
          Isi konteks singkat terlebih dahulu. Data disimpan sebagai lead, lalu WhatsApp terbuka dengan ringkasan yang siap dibaca Education Consultant.
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-200 sm:text-base">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-xs font-black text-white">1</span>
            <span>Pilih program atau minta rekomendasi berdasarkan latar belakangmu.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-xs font-black text-white">2</span>
            <span>Education Consultant menerima konteks sebelum percakapan dimulai.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-xs font-black text-white">3</span>
            <span>Konsultasi gratis, tanpa kewajiban langsung mendaftar.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-9 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-sm text-slate-400">
          Batch terdekat: Oktober 2026 • Basic mulai Rp5.000.000
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="konsultasi" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <LeadForm />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
